% What lesson 20's attenuated token should decide about one request: write file1.
% A fact must be derived; `:- fact.` must never be, and may use variables.
%
%   python3 diagnose.py programs/token.dl --expect programs/token.expect
%   python3 mutation.py programs/token.dl --expect programs/token.expect

allow.                           % the authority block grants write on file1
failed(only_reads).              % ...but the holder's block says reads only
some_check_failed.
:- passes(C).
:- authorized.                   % every check must pass
